t. I am afraid I am the only lover of that opera who knows thi\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 s\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0  admirable little gem, a most characteristic specimen of Verdi\hich\f0 \lquote \loch\f0 
s latest style of melody and harmony. Many years have passed, but I still remember my wrath and grief, when as a young student I first heard a performance of }{\i\insrsid12387527\charrsid9990079 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Falstaff }{
